<main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Six Degrees of Kevin Bacon · A wall of gratitude</div><h1>Little travellers.<br><em>Big-hearted people.</em></h1><p>Behind every photograph, every geocache and every new connection is someone who has given a little of their time to help a tiny traveller on its way.</p><p>This page belongs to those wonderful people. Thank you for making the world feel a little smaller and a little kinder.</p><a class="btn" href="#sammii">Meet our first featured companion ↓</a></div><figure class="portrait"><button type="button" class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge Kevin meeting Santa"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Santa holding Kevin Bacon Challenge Travel Bug #3"></button><figcaption>Kevin meets Santa · Photograph by Sammii</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section" id="sammii"><div class="wrap"><article class="letter"><div class="kicker">25 November 2026 · With love and appreciation</div><h2>A special thank you to Sammii</h2><div class="meta"><span class="tag">Samantha Meyer (ms_sammii)</span><span class="tag">Travel Bug #3 · TBBD913</span><span class="tag">Queensland, Australia</span></div><p>Dear Sammii,</p><p>As our little Kevin Bacon sets off on his next adventure, I want to take a moment to thank you for everything you have done for the Kevin Bacon Challenge.</p><p>From exploring Queensland and visiting geocaches to enjoying bacon and eggs, a strong coffee, a relaxing facial and even meeting Santa Claus, you have truly brought our little traveller to life!</p><p>I've absolutely loved receiving your photographs, reading your updates and seeing the imagination, humour and enthusiasm you have brought to this adventure. Thank you for taking the time to share those little moments and make them so memorable.</p><p>What started as a little idea of mine has become something so much more because of wonderful people like you. This challenge has always been about more than reaching Kevin Bacon. It's about human connections, kindness, friendships and creating memories along the way.</p><p>Thank you for being such a special part of Kevin's journey. You will always have a place in his story.</p><p>Much love and appreciation,</p><p class="sign">Dolphintouch ♡</p><a class="btn secondary" href="./adventures.html#hervey-bay-farewell">Revisit Kevin's Queensland adventures</a><a class="btn secondary" href="https://coord.info/TBBD913" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow Travel Bug #3 ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section gallery-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">A few of our favourite memories</div><h2>From bacon to Santa!</h2><p>Click a photograph to enjoy the full image.</p><div class="gallery"><figure class="photo"><button class="zoom" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge Bacon for breakfast"><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Bacon for breakfast"></button><figcaption><h3>Bacon for breakfast</h3><p>A rather fitting breakfast at Pier Village for a traveller named Kevin Bacon.</p></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="photo"><button class="zoom" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge A coffee break"><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A coffee break"></button><figcaption><h3>A coffee break</h3><p>A strong coffee to keep the adventure going.</p></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="photo"><button class="zoom" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge A little pampering"><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A little pampering"></button><figcaption><h3>A little pampering</h3><p>After all those photoshoots, a much-needed facial.</p></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="photo"><button class="zoom" type="button" aria-label="Enlarge A festive farewell"><img loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A festive farewell"></button><figcaption><h3>A festive farewell</h3><p>A wonderful Christmas photoshoot before the next adventure.</p></figcaption></figure></div><p class="credit">All five photographs on this page are courtesy of Samantha Meyer (ms_sammii).</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap future"><div class="kicker">The adventure continues</div><h2>To every travelling companion</h2><p>Whether you discover a trackable at an event, take one on a holiday, share a film connection, or simply move it to the next cache, you are part of this story. Every little act of kindness matters.</p><p>As our six original travellers and their new companions continue their journeys, this page will grow with more stories of the people who help them along the way.</p><div class="next"><p><strong>Next stop: Norfolk Island!</strong> Thank you to Liz and Bruce for taking Kevin #3 on his next planned adventure. We look forward to the stories still to come.</p><a class="btn secondary" href="./travel-updates.html#norfolk-island">Read the travel update →</a></div></div></section></main>
